GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "983EA123D6DB4F35"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{AAAA705B9742E852}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "1 Battalion has been assigned to secure Montignac. In order to capture it, Alpha company (Your company) has been assigned with secureing EntreDeux to the east. This will allow the battalion to secure Montignac."\
     ""\
     "The time is 0540 with first light at 0555"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0CBA0DCB97803EF0}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation Enemy"
     m_sContent "On west flank a mechanized company is holding the town of Mantignac. On the East flank, a dismounted platoon is holding inside the treeline. A reinforced motor rifle platoon is holding the town of EntreDeux."\
     ""\
     " The enemy has had time to prepare a defensive line and set up entrenched positions along with wire obstacles, hedgehogs and minefields. Any wire obstacle is most likely covered by fire and with a mixture of AT and AP mines. It is suspected that any treeline approach into EntreDeux will have a wire and mine obstacle protecting that approach."\
     ""\
     "Air support has destroyed any armor in the area. As a result, the enemy force is mostly dismounted infantry. "\
     ""\
     ""
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B5EB5919809DCFBD}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Situation Friendly"
     m_sContent "Alpha company is set up in a 2 up T with 2 platoon and 3 platoon on line along the MSR running west to east through Provins. 1 Platoon (Your platoon) is at grid 051 058 ."\
     ""\
     "1 Platoon has been attached an engineer squad and a mounted recce section with 2 m2 gun trucks. "
    }
    GC_Briefing "{07B4012484276649}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "1 Platoon will seize the high ground of EntreDeux 057 070 NLT 0700 hrs in order shape the battle space in order to allow the battalion the begin their attack onto Montignac."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{631561D145E0253D}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Execution"
     m_sContent "1 Platoon will use the attached recce section to locate the enemy and wire obstacle positions. The wire obstacles can be avoided or breached with the attached engineer squad. Once breached 1 platoon will assault and secure EntreDeux."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EE5B59659472F4A8}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Command and Signals"
     m_sContent "Platoon Leader - 1'6 "\
     "Platoon Sergeant - 1'7"\
     "Platoon RTO - 1'6 Romeo"\
     "1st Squad - 1'1 "\
     "2nd Squad - 1'2 "\
     "3rd Squad - 1'3 "\
     "Weapons squad - 1'4 "\
     "Engineer Squad - 1'Echo "\
     "1st Recce Team - Ghost 1 "\
     "1st Recce Team RTO - Ghost 1'Romeo "\
     "2nd Recce Team - Ghost 2"\
     ""\
     "Platoon Net - 48.00"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F789C55D35064FAB}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Service and Support"
     m_sContent "Every rifleman in the riflesquads has been given wire cutters to assist the engineers in breaching the wire obstacles if needed."\
     ""\
     "The engineer squads have wirecutters, demoblocks, mine flags, sandbags and defusing kits. The demo blocks can destroy wire, hedgehods and mines. The flags and sandbags can be used to mark a clear lane through the mine field. "\
     ""\
     "The Recce trucks have extra ammo."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
